		"descr": "There is a description of the components of the various NES/Famicom models and clones. Each board may contain up to 2 PPUs (the \"ppus\" array). Each PPU is bound to a virtual TV Set; the binding is described by the \"tvs\" array (tvs[i] = index of the PPU shown on the i-th TV) and the physical arrangement of the TVs in the window by \"tv_layout\" (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")."
